This software is a Kotlin port derived from SwiftDagre:
https://github.com/lukilabs/dagre-swift

SwiftDagre is itself a port of @dagrejs/dagre:
https://github.com/dagrejs/dagre

The layout algorithms include work described by:
- Gansner et al., "A Technique for Drawing Directed Graphs"
- Brandes and Kopf, "Fast and Simple Horizontal Coordinate Assignment"
- Eades, Lin, and Smyth, "A Fast and Effective Heuristic for the Feedback Arc Set Problem"

